There are just two engravings at niches associated with three trap
types; "Vlad was here" when there is a trapdoor in the niche and
"ad aerarium" in cases of a vault teleporter or level teleporter.

> but I was under the impression that ad aereum closet traps
> always went to the vaults...?

No, that depends on the dungeon level. There may be many niches on
a level. If I read the code correct...

If there are vaults on the level there may be a niche with a vault
teleporter generated with a probability of 1/3.

Until dungeon level 5 and beyond level 24 there there are no
trapdoors in niches. There's a 1/6 probability that a trapdoor
is generated.

Until dungeon level 15 there are no level teleporters in niches.
There's a 1/6 probability that a level teleporter is generated.

